TASK/TX V5.52.20 compatibility parameters for the V5.60.00 executable.

Merge the namelist lines below into the tx group of a txparm to run V5.60.00 with the
default physics of V5.52.20.  They are the only defaults that changed
between V5.52.20 and V5.60.00; all other defaults are unchanged.

  FSLP    = 0.3   k_L of the SOL parallel loss        (V5.60: 1.0)
  MDLSOL  = 0     historical parallel-loss ramp width (V5.60: 1, banana width)
  MDLNZD  = 0     C0-C5 bundle diffused with D01      (V5.60: 1, charged bundle + slaved C0)
  MDLWBC  = 0     no density condition at the wall    (V5.60: 1, zero gradient)
  MDLN0FL = 0     no Larsen limiter on D01            (same in V5.60)

FLlim and RLXN0 are new in V5.60 and are not used with these settings.

 &tx
  FSLP    = 0.3d0
  MDLSOL  = 0
  MDLNZD  = 0
  MDLWBC  = 0
  MDLN0FL = 0
 &end
